PHASE 2 -- tv, photons=100, 29 specs, alpha=0.1, 5 seeds

1. Does the conclusion depend on the error metric?

   shift axis                    coverage (1-SSIM)    coverage (rel l2)   n
   none (in-distribution)           0.895+/-0.007        0.903+/-0.012    1015
   operator shift (Zernike)         0.754+/-0.034        0.704+/-0.018    280
   operator shift (physical)        0.909+/-0.017        0.925+/-0.012    420
   content shift                    0.411+/-0.063        0.005+/-0.004    1566
   combined                         0.006+/-0.002        0.002+/-0.002    432

   largest coverage difference between metrics: 0.407
   The two metrics are different functions of the reconstruction, so
   exact agreement is not expected. What matters is whether the
   ordering and the qualitative failure survive the swap.

   Spearman rho(1-SSIM, rel l2) on the test split: +0.689

